Three new read routes, all backfilling on demand using the same
10-min cooldown helper the lineups/timeline backfill introduced.
A finished match with no rows triggers one syncMatchSummary call,
then re-queries. An upcoming match also works — ESPN's summary
already returns H2H, form, and news for fixtures not yet played.

