Three new tabs on the match detail page, all reading data ESPN's
summary endpoint already returns but we were discarding.

H2H: last 5 meetings between the two teams, with the series
summary line ("PSG leads series 4-1") and a list of past fixtures
with team names, scores, and dates. Form: both teams' last 5
results, reusing the FormStrip component from the Table page (now
exported) plus a compact list of recent games. News: articles
tagged to BOTH teams in this match, reusing the TeamPage news
card layout — same NewsArticle shape, same arrow flip in RTL.

All three backfill on demand: opening a tab for a match with no
stored data triggers one syncMatchSummary call, then the data is
cached in the DB for the next reader. EN + FA, with Persian dates
in Jalali via Intl.

